                                "sense_id": "c8bac73f-72b2-3e70-b5fd-190ed149f063",
                                "text": "Are red socks a secret handshake, a mark of Etonhood, of an allegiance to the place both claimed and disclaimed? And having seen one pair I'm noticing them all over the place, a conspiracy of smallclothes."
